%% ST-01 — Session lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Anonymous: GET login or register
    Anonymous --> Authenticated: valid active credentials + CSRF + audit
    Anonymous --> Anonymous: invalid credentials / 401
    Anonymous --> Anonymous: invalid CSRF / 403
    Anonymous --> Anonymous: registered member / redirect to login
    Anonymous --> Anonymous: account cooldown / 429
    Anonymous --> Expired: anonymous lifetime ends
    Authenticated --> Invalidated: logout + CSRF + audit
    Authenticated --> Expired: configured lifetime ends
    Authenticated --> Invalidated: account inactive or missing
    Authenticated --> Invalidated: password changed or reset, on next validation
    Authenticated --> Lost: memory profile web restart
    Authenticated --> Authenticated: Redis profile web restart while store and token are valid
    Authenticated --> Lost: Redis store loses token
    Invalidated --> Anonymous: next login page
    Expired --> Anonymous: next login page
    Lost --> Anonymous: next login page
    note right of Authenticated
      New cookie after login
      Memory belongs to one web process
      Redis shares sessions across workers
      Redis outage returns 503 without memory fallback
      Roles live in account data
    end note
